#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本当に、この部屋で泊まるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is this really where I'll be staying for the\n"
"foreseeable future?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうだ…休む前に、
#. シャワールームをもう１度調べておかないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh, that's right. I should check the bathroom one more\n"
"time before I go to bed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>女子の部屋だけ鍵が掛かる…はずだったよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Only the girls' bathrooms should have locks on them,\n"
"right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>テレビモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a TV.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何か、こんな物でさえ…
#. 不気味に感じてしまう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even this is enough to make me feel uneasy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はぁ……
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで見られていると思うと、
#. 気分が悪いけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I hate the idea that someone might be watching me\n"
"right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>校則によると、監視カメラを壊したらマズイんだよな。
#. ムカツクけど、放っておくしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We're not allowed to mess with the cameras, so I'd\n"
"better make sure I don't touch it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう夜時間になる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's nighttime already.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 外には出ない方がいいよな。
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'd better not go outside..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>よし、開けてみよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Alright, let's open it up...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガタガタガタ！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 駄目だ、やっぱり鍵が…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's no use. It really is locked."
msgstr ""

#. ブブーッ！　鍵じゃないよっ！
msgctxt "0016 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Bzzt! Wrong! Not locked!"
msgstr ""

#. …うわあっ！！
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Holy crap!"
msgstr ""

#. リアクションが大げさだなぁ。
#. まるで人を幽霊みたいに…
msgctxt "0018 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Jeez, talk about an overreaction. It's like you just\n"
"saw a ghost or somethin'!"
msgstr ""

#. いやっ…この場合は、
#. 『クマを幽霊みたいに』が正しいのかな？
msgctxt "0019 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Like...some kind of...robot bear...ghost."
msgstr ""

#. な、何しに来たんだよっ！
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What are you doing here!?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木誠クン、マジヤバだよ！
#. マジカルなヤバさだよ！
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Makoto Naegi, this is super duper majorly bad! So bad\n"
"it's almost magical!"
msgstr ""

#. ウルトラマジカル！　ヤバヤバアタック！！
msgctxt "0022 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ultra magical awful awful attack!"
msgstr ""

#. 実は、キミの部屋のシャワールームだけ、
#. <CLT 3>ドアの建付け<CLT>が悪い事が判明したのですッ！！
msgctxt "0023 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"In point of fact, I acknowledge that the bathroom in\n"
"your room has <CLT 3>a problem with the doorframe<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. ドアが開かないのは、
#. 鍵じゃなくて建付けのせい…？
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Wait, so the reason it won't open isn't because it's\n"
"locked? The door just...doesn't fit?"
msgstr ""

#. お知らせ読んでないんスか？　字が読めないんスか？
msgctxt "0025 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Didn't you see the notice? What, can't you read?"
msgstr ""

#. 男子のシャワールームには
#. 鍵が掛からないんスよ！
msgctxt "0026 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "The bathrooms in the boys' rooms don't have locks!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、男子のシャワールームに鍵があっても
#. 意味なーいじゃーん！
msgctxt "0027 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I mean, a lock on a boy's bathroom is kinda pointless,\n"
"don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、意味なくはないけど…
#. ボクは…薔薇とか百合とかには詳しくないんで…
msgctxt "0028 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Well, it's not that it's pointless, I guess. But I'm\n"
"no expert on the birds and the bees and all that."
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、その建付けの悪いドアを開くには、
#. ちょっとしたコツが必要な訳で…
msgctxt "0029 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Anyway, there's a little trick to opening this\n"
"particular ill-fitting door."
msgstr ""

#. ボクはそれを教えに来てあげたんだよ。
msgctxt "0030 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "And that's what I'm here to teach you!"
msgstr ""

#. いい？　ドアノブをひねりつつ、
#. 上に持ち上げるようにしながら開けるんだ。
msgctxt "0031 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Okay, ready? So you just gotta turn the doorknob, then\n"
"lift up while you pull!"
msgstr ""

#. ほれ、やってみ？
msgctxt "0032 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Go ahead, give it a try!"
msgstr ""

#. ドアノブをひねりつつ…
#. 上に持ち上げるようにしながら…
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Turn the knob, and lift the door up while I pull..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると…ドアはあっさりと開閉する事が出来た。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When I did that, the door opened without a problem.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷぅ…開いたね…
msgctxt "0035 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu... See? It opened right up!"
msgstr ""

#. でもさぁ、笑えない？
#. キミの部屋のドアだけが建付け悪いなんて…
msgctxt "0036 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Isn't that crazy, though? Your door's the only one\n"
"that doesn't fit quite right!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、超高校級の幸運なんでしょ？
#. それなのに全然ツイてないじゃんね！
msgctxt "0037 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"You're supposed to be the Ultimate Lucky Student,\n"
"right? But looks like you're not lucky at all!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、ボクは唐突な感じで帰るねッ！
msgctxt "0038 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I suddenly don't feel like being here anymore.\n"
"Bye!"
msgstr ""

#. お、おいっ！！　待てよっ！！
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Hey! Wait!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>クソ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Dammit.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えー、校内放送でーす。
#. 午後１０時になりました。
msgctxt "0043 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Mm, ahem, this is a school announcement. It is now 10\n"
"p.m."
msgstr ""

#. ただいまより<CLT 3>“夜時間”<CLT>になります。
msgctxt "0044 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "As such, it is officially <CLT 3>nighttime<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 間もなく食堂はドアをロックされますので、
#. 立ち入り禁止となりま～す。
msgctxt "0045 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Soon the doors to the dining hall will be locked, and\n"
"entry at that point is strictly prohibited."
msgstr ""

#. ではでは、いい夢を。
#. おやすみなさい…
msgctxt "0046 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Okay then...sweet dreams, everyone! Good night, sleep\n"
"tight, don't let the bed bugs bite..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>夜時間か…
#. 外出は禁止の約束だったよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like it's nighttime. We all promised we wouldn't\n"
"leave our rooms now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 今日のところはもう…
#. 大人しく寝るしかないって事か…
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "All I can do now is try and get some sleep..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな独り言を呟きながら、
#. ボクはベッドへと倒れ込み…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>While still mumbling to myself, I collapsed into bed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それと同時に目を閉じた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>My eyes closed almost immediately.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>眠かった訳じゃないけど、
#. ただ、ものすごい疲労感だった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's not that I was ready for bed, exactly. I was just\n"
"utterly exhausted.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まるで１日中ぶっ通しで、
#. 映画を見せ続けられたような疲労感…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was as if I'd spent an entire day staring at a TV\n"
"watching movies.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>自分がフィクションの世界に
#. 放り出されてしまったような錯覚…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Or like some kind of illusion where I'd been tossed\n"
"into a made-up fantastical world.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …当たり前だ。
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, that feels about right..."
msgstr ""

#. いきなり、こんな状況に巻き込まれて、
#. 簡単に受け入れられる訳ないじゃないか…
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There's no easy way to just accept the situation we've\n"
"suddenly been dropped into."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだよ、この鉄板…
#. ここは牢獄じゃないんだぞ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's with this metal barricade? This is supposed to\n"
"be a school, not a prison...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだよ、この鉄板…
#. ここは牢獄じゃないんだぞ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's with this metal barricade? This is supposed to\n"
"be a school, not a prison...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>紙は、はがしたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I tore the paper off the wall, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの内容を思い出すだけでも、
#. 嫌な気分になる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...just remembering what it said still makes me feel\n"
"queasy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここでのルールをメモしろって事か？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is this to remind us of the rules we have to follow\n"
"here?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは…粘着テープクリーナーだな。
#. 掃除はご自由にって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's some kind of lint roller. I guess we're supposed\n"
"to clean up after ourselves...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは…工具セットだな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...a toolkit.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ビニールの包装がされてる。
#. まだ新品の未開封品みたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It must be brand-new. It's still in the shrink-wrap.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>工具セットなんて使う事はないだろうな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see any use for the tool set right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ベッド…
#. 特徴もない普通のものだ…寝心地も普通だし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A bed. It looks pretty normal.\n"
"...Feels normal, too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんて、ボクに言われたくないだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I hope that didn't hurt the bed's feelings...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>特になんの仕掛けもない…
#. 普通のゴミ箱みたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just an everyday trash can. I don't see any kind of\n"
"trapdoor or hidden compartments or anything...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>引き出しのある机だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A desk with a few drawers.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>よくある学生用って感じだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the kind of thing any student would have.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう夜時間になる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Nighttime already...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 外に出ない方がいいよな。
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's best if I stay here, I think."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こうして希望ヶ峰学園での初日は、
#. 幕を閉じていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So this is how the curtain closed on my first day at\n"
"Hope's Peak Academy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このまま眠ってしまって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Soon enough, I was asleep.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>目が覚めたら全部夢だった…
#. なんてオチはどうだろう？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Would it be too much to hope that when I woke up, I'd\n"
"realize it was all a dream?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>オチとしては最低だけど、
#. でも最高だ。それが１番いい。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's kind of lame as far as endings go, but I'd be\n"
"fine with that. Actually, that'd be the best...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 整った設備、優しそうなモノクマ先生。
#. そんな中でこれからの日々がスタートを切ると思うと…
msgctxt "0077 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"In any normal school, Mr. Monokuma would be a kind\n"
"teacher. But when I think about what's coming up..."
msgstr ""

#. ボクはとても誇らしく、嬉しくてなりません。
msgctxt "0078 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...I'm just so full of pride and joy."
msgstr ""

#. 今日は私たち新入生の為にこのような素晴らしい式典を
#. 執り行っていただき、誠にありがとうございました。
msgctxt "0079 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Our ceremony earlier today was absolutely splendid.\n"
"Thank you all very much."
msgstr ""

#. 希望ヶ峰学園の生徒としての自覚を失う事なく、
#. それぞれ、新しい自分の理想を目指して…
msgctxt "0080 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Remember that you're all students of Hope's Peak\n"
"Academy, and strive to refine your ideals."
msgstr ""

#. 明日からの生活を、送っていく事を誓いますっ！
msgctxt "0081 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I swear to you, I will send you all off into\n"
"a new tomorrow!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0082 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. オマエラ、おはようございます！
#. 朝です、７時になりました！　起床時間ですよ～！
msgctxt "0083 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Good morning, everyone! It is now 7 a.m. and nighttime\n"
"is officially over! Time to rise and shine!"
msgstr ""

#. さぁて、今日も張り切っていきましょう～！
msgctxt "0084 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Get ready to greet another beee-yutiful day!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝…らしいな…
#. 窓がないから確かめようもないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Apparently, it's morning... But thanks to the total\n"
"lack of windows, there's no way to know for sure.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とにかく…今日はこれからどうしよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Anyway...what should I do now?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とりあえず、舞園さんを誘って…
#. 彼女と相談してみようかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I should go find Sayaka, and we can figure out\n"
"where to go from here together.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの助手だって…
#. そう言ってくれたんだしな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She did say she's my assistant now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. よし、思い切って、
#. 彼女の部屋に行ってみるか！
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay, it's decided! I'm gonna head to her room!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう決心を固めたところで、
#. ボクは自分の部屋を後にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>With a newfound determination, I left my room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
